UID:event_314450049@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260427T035635Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T074500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T121500
SUMMARY:Slower 1 way ride to Burlington along Lakeshore Blvd.
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nWho’s up for a slower road ride out to 
 Burlington?\n\nStart at the Humber bridge and hop on Lakeshore Blvd. W. to
  Oakville for a breakfast stop. (Aroma Oakville or similar)\nWe’ll head 
 to Burlington along Lakeshore W to Hamilton beach trail and the ride will 
 officially end at Grays road. **The ending time is hopefully a worst case 
 estimate only.**\n\nThere will be plenty of drop out points near gas stati
 ons along the route\, and then choose to ride back or GO train back from B
 urlington GO\n\n**This will be a slower ride!**\nThe top speed will be 25 
 km/hr along flat areas which should be maintainable on a hybrid and slower
  on uphills.\n\nFaster riders are welcome to ride ahead if you know the ro
 ute.\n\nPlease make sure your bike is ready to ride/tuned up and **helmets
  are mandatory**!\n\nHope to see you on this ride or a Niagara century thi
 s summer!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontobikemeetup/events/314450049/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260424T003716Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260424T003716Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
