DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T160000
SUMMARY:Winter Walk Through High Park
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\n7.3 km winter walk at 4 km per hour pace 
 (or faster by consensus) through High Park. Saturday Feb 21\, 2026\, 12 PM
  to 3 PM.\n\n1 PM Meet at High Park Station.\n\n2 PM to 3 PM Near halfway 
 point we will dine at T Dot Jerk restaurant\, 26 Roncesvalles Ave\, Toront
 o\, ON M6R 2K3\, Phone: [(416) 534-5375](https://www.google.com/search?q=T
 +Dot+Jerk+restaurant&rlz=1C1RXMK_enCA1182CA1182&ie=UTF-8#)\, https://tdotj
 erk.ca/\n\n3 PM to 4 PM Return to High Park Station Via High Park Zoo.\n\n
 The Route map bypasses the zoo. On return leg\, just turn left onto Spring
  Road and continue along Deer Pen Rd toward the zoo.\n\nRoute Map with GPX
  download:\nhttps://www.komoot.com/tour/2775222692\n\nAlternate Route Map 
 if trails are accesable:\nhttps://www.komoot.com/tour/2776010341\n\nWear l
 oose fitting winter clothing: coat\, hat\, gloves\, snow pants\, thick soc
 ks\, waterproof thermal lined boots with non slip soles. If necessary put 
 warmers in your gloves and boots. Bring water.\n\nChris 647 453 3327
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontobikemeetup/events/313321625/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260212T055314Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260212T055314Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
